desc:FXD Prism EQ
//tags: equalizer dynamic spectral saturation
//author: FX Devices
// Prism EQ: a 16-band EQ with Pro-Q 4's band params, so FX Devices' Pro-Q device drives it
// (src/FX Layout Plugin Scripts/FXD Prism EQ.lua). Per band:
//   shapes   Bell, Low/High Shelf, Low/High Cut, Notch, Band Pass, Tilt Shelf, Flat Tilt, All Pass
//   slopes   6..96 dB/oct and Brickwall; stereo placement Stereo / Left / Right / Mid / Side
//   dynamics range < 0 compresses, > 0 expands above the threshold (global attack, release,
//            ratio; internal or external side chain on pins 3/4). Dynamics Mode Spectral runs
//            them per FFT bin inside the band's region (latency = spectral resolution)
//   saturation  Tape, Tube, Transistor, Soft Clip, Hard Clip, Diode, Fold, Bitcrush on the
//            band's own region, anti-aliased (ADAA + 2x / 4x oversampling), level-matched to the
//            Drive and DC-free; Saturation Mix blends it with the clean band
//   auto     Auto Attack / Release sets the times from the band's crest factor (fast on
//            transients, slow on sustained material, longer for low bands); Auto Threshold
//            (a per-band bit mask) tracks the band's long-term level, 3 dB above it
// (A JSFX has at most 256 sliders: 16 x 15 band sliders + 16 globals.)
// Globals: Zero Latency / Linear Phase (a linear-phase FIR, Linear Phase Length sets its
// latency), Character (Clean / Subtle / Warm), Auto Gain, Gain Scale, Saturation Oversampling,
// Output level and pan. Filters are analog prototypes matched to their analog magnitude up to
// Nyquist (no bilinear cramping). The @gfx GUI uses the Monolith look.

slider1:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Band 1 Used
slider2:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Band 1 Enabled
slider3:1000<10,30000,0.01:log>-Band 1 Frequency
slider4:0<-30,30,0.01>-Band 1 Gain
slider5:1<0.025,40,0.001:log>-Band 1 Q
slider6:0<0,9,1{Bell,Low Shelf,Low Cut,High Shelf,High Cut,Notch,Band Pass,Tilt Shelf,Flat Tilt,All Pass}>-Band 1 Shape
slider7:1<0,9,1{6 dB/oct,12 dB/oct,18 dB/oct,24 dB/oct,30 dB/oct,36 dB/oct,48 dB/oct,72 dB/oct,96 dB/oct,Brickwall}>-Band 1 Slope
